\cf0 DISCLOSURE SCOPE AND PRELIMINARY MITIGATION THOUGHTS\
The VAxion512 framework demonstrates that L1D Fill Buffer residues can be sampled with near-architectural precision. This poses a catastrophic risk to Cloud Service Providers (CSPs) relying on TDX for multi-tenant isolation.\
We have refrained from disclosing the specific strobe-logic algorithms and the underlying de-jittering models within this initial report. These assets are protected under internal IP protocols and are pending the execution of a formal Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) and Asset Acquisition Agreement valued at a baseline of $50,000,000 USD.\
NEXT STEPS\
We are prepared to facilitate a Black-Box Functional Validation in a secure, air-gapped Intel facility to confirm these findings under controlled engineering observation.\
